  "_notes": "Our own Git-backed CMS for OSP's Dancing with the Stars 2026 page. ONE collection ('Dancing With The Stars Stars' in Webflow, id 66b90685bd1fb0490773a1e3 on site 64dc6469dc8981cbbbb73864) drives THREE on-page sections via the 'section' field: '2026-cast', '2026-staff', '2025-cast' (the 'Thank You To Our 2025 Cast' archive block). Card = photo (image-12 board-image) + name (text-block-24-copy nopad) + a 'Learn More' popup with a larger photo (image-40) + bio (cfr-staff-bio-text w-richtext). 'image' = filename in ./assets/ OR a full http(s) URL (accepted verbatim); we use the live Webflow CDN URLs. 'preview': true = preview URL only; false/omit = live in production. 'role' is optional. See ../README.md and ../../../../HYBRID-CMS.md.",
  "_provenance": "Baked 2026-06-26 by Studio Lead from the live OSP 'Dancing With The Stars Stars' Webflow CMS via the Data API. 2026-cast = the 8 dancers (year 2026, role Dancer), ordered by order-number 1-8. 2026-staff = Tara Faires (Artistic Director) + Blake+Erica (MCs). 2025-cast = the 8-member 2025 archive (year 2025). 2024 dancers were skipped (not on this page). The hybrid render has no native vote/support button, so each dancer's donorperfect 'Support Dancer' link (and each 2025 archive member's YouTube performance link) is folded into the 'bio' popup to preserve the fundraising/watch CTA.",
  "_preview_state": "Mirrors Webflow draft/publish state as of 2026-06-26: only Molly Redmon + both staff are PUBLISHED in Webflow; the other 7 2026 dancers are still Webflow DRAFTS, so they carry preview:true here (visible on the preview URL, hidden in production) until Arch publishes them / Mat says go live. Flip preview:false to take each live.",
